{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：21:52 2026-08-30 HKT</p>\n\n<p>香港小姐決賽2026去到萬眾矚目的泳裝環節，大會決賽推陳出新，以冰雪之地去包裝泳裝環節，12位佳麗內裏雖穿上比堅尼泳衣，但外面卻着上毛毛皮衣外衫，以及用毛毛裹腳。佳麗們行出台前開心起舞，再配以大會安排的濃濃白色噴霧，的確是有雪地的效果，但卻似乎令人看不清佳麗的出眾好身材。</p>\n<h2>比堅尼突顯佳麗曲線</h2>\n<p>之後佳麗立即進入「敢‧迎擊」泳裝答問環節，佳麗照樣身披皮草進場，到最後一刻才將外衣脫下見「真身」，騷出內裏身穿比堅尼泳衣的身材。今次大會準備的三點式泳衣款式，可以凸顯到佳麗的身材，而褲子的側邊就採綁繩設計，頗為性感。</p>\n<img alt=\"佳麗泳裝出場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/45a8ab96c13ebc0294a3c7be6a16ab4f/2026-08/a_0_2.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣熱爆舞台。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ab779fd62b969b24beb5a27a5017e9b1/2026-08/b_1.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"12位佳麗各有美態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/aa9195806825b216662365209a22b43e/2026-08/c_2.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"3號李澄晴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/78b56a94856fc13b28531dd3e695583d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_9_21_16_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"10號陳梓穎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/70ccfb5b89cc8ce64ff195160df90be6/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_9_21_16_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"10號陳梓穎背面吸引。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/fcd3ea9cb88aa52fc2e3e09eb819ee35/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_9_21_20_PM_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"10號陳梓穎口材亦不俗。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4f246e8719128b2bcb8e6761df59fdc7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_9_23_58_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2號李澤欣被封為大熱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b17923067a90ca343b558881bf374b19/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_9_24_01_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2號李澤欣和11號顏懿菲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/598c42529878d5be79491dbcc75b8c30/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-30_at_9_24_03_PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"佳麗於「冰天雪地」外穿皮草內穿比堅尼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c97351e4fe89700a9849e2a76c6c4bd7/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801581_58__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣好突出。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec4207a004580271b6ab934f6f92d8f0/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801582_34_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"1號袁絲珩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bb9359643fbdd9e2907b4386166c753/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801584_13_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"12號湯家琳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1597bd7153aaac5a89e0e5a50f66ec9/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801584_39_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"1號袁絲珩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/282e5c33a04a65d60f035814ca9e6f07/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801585_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2號李澤欣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6db48f1e3d555b3bf786e8eecd27f7fc/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801587_54_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"2號李澤欣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/47a51c65b56256a33ab792e7e11c9c9b/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801587_58_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"11號顏懿菲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f1cd915fc8f7d8e1c519cb3a4ee67010/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801588_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"11號顏懿菲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/623c878e6cd6f775e84bba77007311eb/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801588_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"3號李澄晴。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/84e53f4fe460c4059a6b98817a047db0/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801591_01_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"10號陳梓穎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49a445a2347bca73b6adf23fb052b606/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801591_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/37afddd29ba1a27520a795ca7ed38e66/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801601_09_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣好標青。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f7763f5bf4d26fbfa8714d438aedd519/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801601_17_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"8號鄧匡閔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ae95104c1441ea68a17c83a5cd2baf5e/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801601_45_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣於台上頻頻俯身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0b1c658279c40dbe81aac296f9b9eb1/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801602_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣身材吸引。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95583e512f11d0ad23c3d360459d1e4c/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801602_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣笑容吸睛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/22d87f7e4edcd757914c9986090ed9af/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801602_33_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"5號魏欣再次俯身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db4bb6132c9e5a4aee0fcd93dba78f24/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801602_49_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"6號盧蔚晴\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e376667c8cba281532a5d564e977931/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801604_08_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"7號楊媛媛\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/86abbc8632a3eed1922cc28366d21e83/2026-08/VS--LIVE81-myTVSUPER-29801604_32_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>魏欣台上頻俯身</h2>\n<p>今屆港姐身材最標青的必屬5號魏欣，她的三圍是34.5、22、34，她雖然外披皮草，不過上圍仍然幾乎奪衣而出，因為身材甚佳的關係，台下的掌聲亦甚為熱烈。她於台上接受接龍挑戰，她不時俯身向前看旁邊的字牌，令其性感身材更加澎湃。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-30T15:38:35.156193+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":401,"images":29,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}